<title>HONG KONG: Top Form posts HK$49.8 mln interim loss.</title>
<headline>Top Form posts HK$49.8 mln interim loss.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   7.45 loss  vs 10.23 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  27.50 loss vs 39.02 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    49.77 loss vs 68.31 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     415.49     vs 479.74</p>
<p>    Company name		 Top Form International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Top Form International makes underwear.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss of HK$22 million on provison for losses arising from the bankruptcy proceedings of the company's French subsidiaries, and a loss of HK$5.5 million on professional fees incurred in connection with its business restructuring exercise.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
